 <!-- Executive Overview -->
 <div class="section-card">
 <h2>Executive Overview</h2>
 <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
 Q3 demonstrated steady performance across core business vectors. The rollout of <strong>Project Aether</strong> was completed three weeks ahead of schedule, driving a surge in new Enterprise tier sign-ups. Infrastructure operations experienced minor latency spikes during late August due to data center migrations, but overall uptime remained within SLA parameters at 99.94%. Primary focus for Q4 shifts toward mitigating customer churn in mid-market segments and closing key enterprise contracts.
 </p>
 </div>
 <div style="display: none;">
