 <th>Project Name</th>
 <th>Lead Owner</th>
 <th>Target Date</th>
 <th>Status</th>
 <th>Notes</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>Project Aether</strong> (v4.0 Migration)</td>
 <td>Marcus Thorne</td>
 <td>Sep 15, 2026</td>
 <td><span class="badge badge-green">Complete</span></td>
 <td>Successfully migrated 100% of legacy nodes.</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>Vortex Analytics Engine</strong></td>
 <td>Dr. Aris Thorne</td>
 <td>Nov 30, 2026</td>
 <td><span class="badge badge-yellow">At Risk</span></td>
 <td>Third-party API rate limits delaying testing.</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>SOC 2 Type II Compliance</strong></td>
 <td>Sanjay Patel</td>
 <td>Dec 15, 2026</td>
 <td><span class="badge badge-green">On Track</span></td>
 <td>Audit phase 2 underway; non-conformances cleared.</td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
 <td><strong>Mobile UI Redesign</strong></td>
 <td>Clara Oswald</td>
 <td>Oct 01, 2026</td>
 <td><span class="badge badge-red">Delayed</span></td>
 <td>Frontend staffing shortage; revised launch for Jan 2027.</td>
 </tr>
 </tbody>
 </table>
 </div>

 <!-- Risks & Blockers -->
 <div class="section-card">
 <h2>Key Risks & Mitigation Strategies</h2>
 <ul>
 <li>
 <strong>Data Center Latency (Technical):</strong> Migration to Region-US-East caused minor latency degradation (+5ms).
 <br><em>Mitigation:</em> DevOps team deploying edge CDN caching by October 25.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>Mid-Market Renewal Drop-off (Revenue):</strong> Churn rose by 0.4% in non-enterprise tiers.
 <br><em>Mitigation:</em> Customer Success executing dedicated retention outreach campaign with tailored discount options.
 </li>
 </ul>
 </div>

 <!-- Immediate Action Items -->
 <div class="section-card">
 <h2>Next Steps & Priorities (Q4 Objectives)</h2>
 <ol style="color: var(--text-secondary); padding-left: 1.25rem;">
 <li>Finalize annual budget reviews for FY 2027 with finance leadership by Nov 10.</li>
 <li>Unblock external API integration issues for the Vortex Analytics Engine.</li>
 <li>Backfill 2 Senior Frontend Engineering positions to resume Mobile UI development.</li>
 </ol>
 </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>

